sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "127d291af14b36e0dea39d478e0381bd3256f8d6", "message": "Update 30.html", "created_at": "2025-04-02T11:18:08Z", "repo": "vizzle", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "177a13ab534c50faa23a793ec70a1447ec66d3fe", "message": "Undo screwup", "created_at": "2025-04-02T10:58:26Z", "repo": "vizzle", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "baaf8a53f8763296533a79242b60f113f33a72dc", "message": "Specific puzzle based localstorage", "created_at": "2025-04-02T10:55:58Z", "repo": "vizzle", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "82e922e3e3a0fd4393f546161e1587cb5e892699", "message": "30.html. Introduced LocalStorage, Undo auto-toggle\n\nGame Title Change\n30.html: Title updated to \u201cPaint it All.\u201d\n\nUndo Functionality Adjustments\n30.html: Undo is now enabled by default (CONFIG.showUndo set to true). In addition, a new persistent undo mechanism has been implemented\u2014if a player resets the game enough times (reset counter meets a threshold), the undo feature remains permanently enabled across sessions.\n\nNew Reset Counter and Free Reset Mechanism\nNew Feature: A reset counter (stored under the key paintItFullResetCounter) has been added to track how many times the player has reset the grid.\n\nFree Reset: When a new achievement is attained, the next reset becomes free (using a free reset flag stored as paintItFullFreeReset).\nLogic: The resetGame() function now includes logic to:\nConsume a free reset (if available) without incrementing the counter.\nOtherwise, increment the counter.\nCheck if the reset counter reaches a set threshold (UNDO_THRESHOLD, now set to 30) to permanently enable the undo functionality (persisted under paintItFullUndoEnabled).\n\nLocal Storage Enhancements\nNew Keys Added:\npaintItFullResetCounter\npaintItFullFreeReset\npaintItFullUndoEnabled\n\nThese keys ensure that the reset counter, free reset status, and persistent undo flag are maintained across sessions without affecting the achievements display.", "created_at": "2025-04-02T10:22:14Z", "repo": "vizzle", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6e47b908d6e8870c17f228497bf303d47a59f094", "message": "Creted 29 and 29Hard PiF", "created_at": "2025-03-30T07:57:04Z", "repo": "vizzle", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c6332f30265022207ed38d03c8e3be99946ffc71", "message": "Update 28.html", "created_at": "2025-03-29T12:24:10Z", "repo": "vizzle", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c3ab08c7f46c824d80d6b92c937f68630ba9d4c5", "message": "Update 28H.html", "created_at": "2025-03-29T11:57:24Z", "repo": "vizzle", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "197a66fa3861f37c2475b2eceb061f597cc1e024", "message": "Updated updateStars function\n\nFixed a bug which did not allow star score to be upgraded to better score.", "created_at": "2025-03-29T11:00:03Z", "repo": "vizzle", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ec282995911932e8c2898073f38de477aab43e39", "message": "Created PiF #28 and #28 Hard\n\nInstead of individual puzzles, making sets of puzzles of similar layouts with increasing difficulty.\n\nFor now - Normal and Hard are put together. Will make a Hell level later as well once access to better mechanics are there.\n\nAlso Added Favicon.", "created_at": "2025-03-29T10:28:27Z", "repo": "vizzle", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e4878f36edf34df5bedfb910d975a8ab2f46c286", "message": "Update 27.html\n\nImplemented win codnition to ignore blocked cells", "created_at": "2025-03-28T13:54:25Z", "repo": "vizzle", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c817f5a5ed859294249b85dfcb783955a1af2fb0", "m